# Citation metadata in the Citation File Format, https://citation-file-format.github.io/
#
# Zenodo reads this file when it archives a GitHub release, so these fields become
# the metadata of the Zenodo record and its DOI. Version and release date are
# deliberately left out: Zenodo takes them from the GitHub release itself, so a
# release pull request only ever touches build.sbt and CHANGELOG.md.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use uml2semantics in your work, please cite it using this metadata.
type: software
title: uml2semantics
abstract: >-
  uml2semantics translates UML class diagrams, supplied as TSV files or as XMI
  exported from tools such as Enterprise Architect, into OWL 2 ontologies, so
  that a reasoner can check the model for inconsistencies and unintended
  consequences.
authors:
  - family-names: Harmse
    given-names: Henriette
    # orcid: https://orcid.org/XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX
repository-code: https://github.com/henrietteharmse/uml2semantics
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - UML
  - OWL 2
  - ontology
  - XMI
  - conceptual modelling
